  - statementId: 9
    basicConversation:
    - id: 9
      conversation: As you may already know, it is essential for us the assassins to defeat an opponent quickly and precisely. In order to do that we must reduce the unnecessary movements.  The problem is that it really is hard to understand the unnecessary movements without actual field experiences. As all the people have different looks, each one has unique habit when performing a same skill and those habits create vulnerability. Therefore, field experiences are essential to find out what unnecessary movements they each have.
